{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0000", "block": 0, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 34, "sha256": "c64bc61bc1d864c6", "text": "Week 3 — Build a Custom MCP Server"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0001", "block": 1, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 99, "sha256": "e2c888676288482b", "text": "Design and implement a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that wraps a real external API. You may:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0002-i00", "block": 2, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 92, "sha256": "d3d9fc0523cbc89f", "text": "Run it **locally** (STDIO transport) and integrate with an MCP client (like Claude Desktop)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0002-i01", "block": 2, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 120, "sha256": "adc0d7bba9ad916b", "text": "Or run it **remotely** (HTTP transport) and call it from a model agent or client. This is harder but earns extra credit."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0003", "block": 3, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 100, "sha256": "25bb4974a16bd89d", "text": "Bonus points for adding authentication (API keys or OAuth2) aligned with the MCP Authorization spec."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0004", "block": 4, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 14, "sha256": "9e640a9ea1a22ac5", "text": "Learning goals"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0005-i00", "block": 5, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 60, "sha256": "3e0bd0c44061f946", "text": "Understand core MCP capabilities: tools, resources, prompts."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0005-i01", "block": 5, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 75, "sha256": "2682477c8aa69f24", "text": "Implement tool definitions with typed parameters and robust error handling."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0005-i02", "block": 5, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 74, "sha256": "103a1cd868a28bf8", "text": "Follow logging and transport best practices (no stdout for STDIO servers)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0005-i03", "block": 5, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 61, "sha256": "3aa07d85af0c7aad", "text": "Optionally implement authorization flows for HTTP transports."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0006", "block": 6, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 12, "sha256": "e0cdd07f6a270b82", "text": "Requirements"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i00", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 194, "sha256": "b9d6c3b49d030b1e", "text": "Choose an external API and document which endpoints you’ll use. Examples: weather, GitHub issues, Notion pages, movie/TV databases, calendar, task managers, finance/crypto, travel, sports stats."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i01", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 29, "sha256": "bd17b95f0028723e", "text": "Expose at least two MCP tools"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i02", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 27, "sha256": "397ae475cb3b1531", "text": "Implement basic resilience:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i03", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 63, "sha256": "16458d67c4254a5f", "text": "Graceful errors for HTTP failures, timeouts, and empty results."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i04", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 70, "sha256": "f5d507630e90a887", "text": "Respect API rate limits (e.g., simple backoff or user-facing warning)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i05", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 19, "sha256": "103c98eb806823af", "text": "Packaging and docs:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i06", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 74, "sha256": "feed58c9dbeb5669", "text": "Provide clear setup instructions, environment variables, and run commands."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i07", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 91, "sha256": "b1aadeb7d9739228", "text": "Include an example invocation flow (what to type/click in the client to trigger the tools)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i08", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 27, "sha256": "ceef7d79b47a07fa", "text": "Choose one deployment mode:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i09", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 108, "sha256": "ca42851d15b50e8d", "text": "Local: STDIO server, runnable from your machine and discoverable by Claude Desktop or an AI IDE like Cursor."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i10", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 141, "sha256": "dcef716872946d5a", "text": "Remote: HTTP server accessible over the network, callable by an MCP-aware client or an agent runtime. Extra credit if deployed and reachable."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i11", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 32, "sha256": "03a944fc9637565b", "text": "(Optional) Bonus: Authentication"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i12", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 69, "sha256": "2b77e8b387d524ff", "text": "API key support via environment variable and client configuration; or"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0007-i13", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 123, "sha256": "525df3fbe8170fc2", "text": "OAuth2-style bearer tokens for HTTP transport, validating token audience and never passing tokens through to upstream APIs."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0008", "block": 8, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 12, "sha256": "c7ec4b92c29ba226", "text": "Deliverables"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0009-i00", "block": 9, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 107, "sha256": "984da476abb73862", "text": "Source code under `week3/` (suggested: `week3/server/` with a clear entrypoint like `main.py` or `app.py`)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0009-i01", "block": 9, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 23, "sha256": "47e08051458d67be", "text": "`week3/README.md` with:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0009-i02", "block": 9, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 77, "sha256": "e31e8a31e512bb9a", "text": "Prerequisites, environment setup, and run instructions (local and/or remote)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0009-i03", "block": 9, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 95, "sha256": "d0daf58e09ff8934", "text": "How to configure the MCP client (Claude Desktop example for local) or agent runtime for remote."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0009-i04", "block": 9, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 82, "sha256": "d892ebdd1a0453df", "text": "Tool reference: names, parameters, example inputs/outputs, and expected behaviors."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0010", "block": 10, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 32, "sha256": "74f533e367f36c66", "text": "Evaluation rubric (90 pts total)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i00", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 85, "sha256": "29460a260a79e8a5", "text": "Functionality (35): Implements 2+ tools, correct API integration, meaningful outputs."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i01", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 82, "sha256": "7967bf193bd08623", "text": "Reliability (20): Input validation, error handling, logging, rate-limit awareness."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i02", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 92, "sha256": "5d98ce3704dee33e", "text": "Developer experience (20): Clear setup/docs, easy to run locally; sensible folder structure."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i03", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 101, "sha256": "c4226bee03c283b2", "text": "Code quality (15): Readable code, descriptive names, minimal complexity, type hints where applicable."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i04", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 18, "sha256": "0353a697ac6b9131", "text": "Extra credit (10):"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i05", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 85, "sha256": "9e7ae7f4a8afaac4", "text": "+5 Remote HTTP MCP server, callable by an agent/client such as the OpenAI/Claude SDK."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0011-i06", "block": 11, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 75, "sha256": "c6a4198ceb21cf2c", "text": "+5 Auth implemented correctly (API key or OAuth2 with audience validation)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0012", "block": 12, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 18, "sha256": "3ad5e4f38f89b686", "text": "Helpful references"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week3-assignmentmd#b0013-i00", "block": 13, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 118, "sha256": "35728202acff05e6", "text": "MCP Server Quickstart: [modelcontextprotocol.io/quickstart/server](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/quickstart/server)."}
